# Code_Aster Command File - Generated by MecwayAsterBridge
# Template for the harmonic response of a structure in the
# frequency domain (analysis harmonic_3d; Mecway has no analysis
# type for it): eigenmodes (CALC_MODES), the frequency list with extra
# points around the resonances (DEFI_LIST_FREQ), the harmonic response on a
# modal basis (PROJ_BASE, DYNA_VIBRA TYPE_CALCUL='HARM' BASE_CALCUL='GENE',
# REST_GENE_PHYS) or directly (BASE_CALCUL='PHYS'), complex stresses
# (CALC_CHAMP) and per frequency amplitude and phase to Mecway. Filled in
# via str.format() from bridge_harmonic.py.
#
# Placeholders (name between single braces):
#   defigroup_block   -> DEFI_GROUP / CREA_MAILLAGE / MODI_MAILLAGE
#   model_block       -> AFFE_MODELE per elset
#   cara_elem_block   -> AFFE_CARA_ELEM (beams, shells, springs, point masses)
#   materials_block   -> DEFI_MATERIAU per material (with RHO)
#   fieldmat_block    -> AFFE_MATERIAU assignment
#   load_funcs_block  -> DEFI_FONCTION per Mecway table (function of FREQ)
#   loads_block       -> AFFE_CHAR_MECA(_F): supports and loads
#   assemblage_block  -> ASSEMBLAGE: RIGI_MECA, MASS_MECA (and AMOR_MECA of
#                        dampers) with the supports
#   calc_modes_block  -> modes = CALC_MODES(...) and the mode overview
#   projection_block  -> load vectors (CALC_VECT_ELEM, ASSE_VECTEUR),
#                        PROJ_BASE (GENE) or the damping matrix (PHYS)
#   harm_block        -> modal damping, frequency list, DYNA_VIBRA HARM
#                        (and REST_GENE_PHYS) -> res
#   calc_champ_block  -> CALC_CHAMP SIGM_NOEU (complex) on res
#   export_block      -> aster_harmonic_export (Mecway results per
#                        frequency, measuring points)
#   impr_resu_block   -> IMPR_RESU MED (only with "med_export")
#
# A brace that is not a placeholder: double it ({{ or }}).

DEBUT(LANG='EN')

# =====================================================
# 1. MESH (FORMAT='ASTER', bridge_mesh.py; UNITE=20 = 'F mail ... D 20')
# =====================================================
mesh = LIRE_MAILLAGE(UNITE=20, FORMAT='ASTER')

mesh = DEFI_GROUP(
    reuse=mesh,
    MAILLAGE=mesh,
    CREA_GROUP_MA=_F(
        NOM='all_elems',
        TOUT='OUI',
    ),
    CREA_GROUP_NO=_F(
        NOM='all_nodes',
        GROUP_MA='all_elems',
    ),
)

{defigroup_block}

# =====================================================
# 2. MODEL, SECTIONS, MATERIALS (as in MECA_STATIQUE)
# =====================================================
{model_block}

{cara_elem_block}

{materials_block}

{fieldmat_block}

# =====================================================
# 3. LOADS (amplitude; tables as a function of frequency)
# =====================================================
{load_funcs_block}

{loads_block}

# =====================================================
# 4. MATRICES (ASSEMBLAGE, U4.61.21) AND EIGENMODES (CALC_MODES, U4.52.02)
# =====================================================
{assemblage_block}

{calc_modes_block}

# =====================================================
# 5. LOAD VECTORS AND PROJECTION ONTO THE MODES (PROJ_BASE, U4.63.11)
# =====================================================
{projection_block}

# =====================================================
# 6. HARMONIC RESPONSE (DYNA_VIBRA HARM, U4.53.03) AND BACK TO THE
#    NODES (REST_GENE_PHYS, U4.63.31)
# =====================================================
{harm_block}

# =====================================================
# 7. STRESSES AND RESULTS TO MECWAY
# =====================================================
{calc_champ_block}

{export_block}

{impr_resu_block}

FIN()
